  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2022-26 HUM Niger 2026NI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective of the country programme 2022-25:Contribute to the socio-economic development and improved resilience of vulnerable households in Niamey, and internally displaced people, refugees and host communities in the region of Tillab&#xe9;ri affected by the multidimensional crisis.The country engagement has the following outcomes:1. Crisis-affected households (IDPs, host communities and refugees) in the region of Tillab&#xe9;ri have covered their basic needs through food voucher and cash for work and improved sanitary conditions though construction of latrines. 2. Acutely malnourished children under five have recovered through community led response.</narrative>
  </description>
